---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config/site';
---
<PageLayout title="Terms of Use" description={`Terms of use for ${SITE_NAME}: acceptable use, no warranty, limitation of liability and intellectual property.`} path="/terms/">
  <p>By using {SITE_NAME} (the "Site") you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>
  <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
  <p>The Site provides free calculators and educational content for personal, non-commercial use. You agree not to misuse it: do not attempt to disrupt it, scrape it at a volume that harms performance, or copy its content and republish it as your own.</p>
  <h2>No advice, no warranty</h2>
  <p>The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. Results are estimates only and are not financial, tax or legal advice. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the Site or its results.</p>
  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The Site's text, design and code are owned by its operator or its licensors. You may link to any page. You may not reproduce substantial parts without written permission.</p>
  <h2>Advertising and third parties</h2>
  <p>The Site may display third-party ads and link to third-party sites. We are not responsible for their content or practices. See the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms and the Site at any time. Continued use after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
